  "slug": "find-three-consecutive-integers-that-sum-to-a-given-number",
  "title": "找到和为给定整数的三个连续整数",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-032",
  "studyTags": [
    "数学"
  ],
  "summary": "给定整数 num，若存在三个连续整数之和为 num，返回这三个数，否则返回空数组。",
  "insight": "三个连续整数可写成 x-1、x、x+1，总和为 3x。因此 num 能被三整除是充要条件，中间数为 num/3。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "返回值使用 long",
    "不能整除时返回空数组",
    "整数可以包含零或负数"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "divisibility-by-three",
      "title": "整除三直接构造",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "由连续三数的代数和得到唯一候选。",
      "steps": [
        "若 num%3!=0 返回空",
        "middle=num/3",
        "返回 [middle-1,middle,middle+1]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(1)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/divisibility-by-three/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/divisibility-by-three/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/divisibility-by-three/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
